\check Create Readable Lexicon
\description Reads the active project's lexicon.xml (Word Analyses lexicon) and creates a plain, easy-to-read HTML page listing every word/stem, prefix, and suffix together with its gloss(es), in three separate sections (Words &amp; Stems, Prefixes, Suffixes) with a search box to filter entries. A permanent copy named lexicon_readable.html is saved in the project folder, and it also opens automatically in your web browser.

\subMenu Lexicon (experimental)

\noText
\toHtml
\utf8

\script LexiconReadable.py
\programToRun Python
